{"texts":{"items":{"storebox":{"b":"這裡收納曾經放在牆上的物件","pop":false,"h":"這裡收納曾經放在牆上的物件"},"whitewall":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"emptycab":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"buddha":{"pop":false,"h":"臥佛"},"sidetable":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"tv":{"pop":false,"h":"電視"},"tvstand":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"speaker":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"console":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"gamepad":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"minitable":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"cocoa":{"pop":false,"h":"熱可可"},"pudding":{"pop":false,"h":"布丁"},"remote":{"pop":false,"h":"遙控器"},"pocky":{"pop":false,"h":"Pocky"},"door":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"plant":{"pop":false},"pothos":{"pop":false,"h":"黃金葛"},"succulent":{"pop":false},"water":{"pop":false},"curtain":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"eastwindow":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"dog1":{"t":"Middle","pop":false,"h":"Middle"},"cat1":{"pop":false,"h":"漫漫"},"cat2":{"pop":false,"h":"娜娜"},"cat3":{"pop":false,"h":"小羽"},"cat4":{"pop":false,"h":"大頭"},"bed":{"pop":false,"h":"躺躺看"},"sakura":{"pop":false,"h":"曾經的夢境場景"},"hchair":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"beanbag":{"pop":false},"sofa":{"pop":false},"armchair":{"pop":false},"rug":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"mugtable":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"mug":{"pop":false,"h":"還溫溫的。"},"shelf":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"blank":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"swcab":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"memcab":{"pop":false},"btable":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"chair":{"pop":false},"otable":{"pop":false,"hov":false},"flyer":{"pop":false},"fire":{"pop":false},"drink:0":{"pop":false,"h":"柚子氣泡"},"drink:1":{"pop":false,"h":"百香果冰茶"}},"fire":46},"exhibits":{"items":{"cougar":{"kind":"紀錄","title":"曾經到訪的美洲獅","desc":"某個我在房間的午後，美洲獅在門口等待我的邀請，進門後牠一句話也沒說，安靜地走到角落窩著。\n我和牠約好每天都回來看牠，每天我都在差不多的時間來到房間靜靜的躺在牠身邊感受他。\n\n牠是我體內深層的一股憤怒，沒有特定事件，而是貫穿許多時空累積化形而成的型態。牠只需要我看見牠，接納牠的存在。我遇見牠的那天，是我在身上感受到一股在腹部灼燒的感受。\n\n過了第四天，我已經習慣牠的存在，陪著牠呼吸。接著隔天我就再也沒見到牠，甚至有些捨不得牠的離去。","hidden":false,"mode":"lean","along":-2.08,"height":1.45,"hover":true,"popup":true,"scale":1},"lightvid":{"kind":"影像","title":"光","desc":"","hidden":false,"mode":"hang","along":0.65,"height":1.5,"hover":true,"popup":true,"scale":0.9999999999999998},"recordwall":{"kind":"紀錄","title":"勳章","desc":"曾經認為，那些走過的痛苦與癒合的傷痕，是值得驕傲的勳章。\n\n但後來發現，這些勳章不知不覺成了貼在自己身上的標籤，限制了我對自己的認知，讓我一度以「曾經受過傷的人」來定義自己，也框架了周遭的關係。\n\n我想我不再需要這些勳章。\n\n過去的經歷依然重要，或許也不再重要，我不必再透過它們認識自己。我可以選擇如何定義「我」。","hidden":false,"mode":"hang","along":1.55,"height":1.62,"hover":true,"popup":true,"scale":0.9953343701399688}}},"tv":{"assetId":"cf9731c331c78faa8bb1670e3dea7cfd","name":"adventure.mp4","updatedAt":1793183600000,"view":{"blur":true,"fit":"auto","offX":0,"offY":0,"scale":134}},"music":{"tracks":[{"assetId":"3a9c08525c4469c965bc9741fe188c19","kind":"video","name":"Blue_720p"}],"links":[{"title":"Blue","url":"https://youtu.be/Yt7ZGcfJIL0?si=ptJUTn6AuJxFPQ-Y"},{"title":"境界と旅路」","url":"https://youtu.be/2SDIyyP6Rqc?si=KEkIp6LE5VFPqT_6"}]},"savedAt":1793621500013}